    brand_text:`Scalp micropigmentation is now <strong>one of the most effective non-surgical hair restoration techniques</strong> for those who want to address hair loss and regain density. At Reset SMP, we recreate the look of shaved or very short hair, densify thinning areas and camouflage scars. <strong>The result is natural and long-lasting</strong>, thanks to a precise reproduction of hair follicles.`,
